blitemHdr] I INNER JOIN EMR.tblFavourites F ON I.item_ID=F.itemID WHERE F.doctorID = @doctorId AND F.favType = \'I\'`. This can improve performance by avoiding the need to re-evaluate the subquery for each row."""\nQuery Rewrite 2: """Use client statistics and actual execution plan in Sql Server Management Studio to analyze the query performance. Also, clean the cache before running the query to avoid cache side effect on performance."""\n...', 'time': 9.007152080535889}
